    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Only Card Game Where You Can Collect, Battle, and Trade\u2026 Everything.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411830/extras/2e3f3e1f468f08fdab2044c870c0667d.poster.avif?t=1749758616\" width=800 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411830/extras/2e3f3e1f468f08fdab2044c870c0667d.webm?t=1749758616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411830/extras/2e3f3e1f468f08fdab2044c870c0667d.mp4?t=1749758616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Ever wondered who\u2019d win in a fight, <strong>Loki</strong> or a <strong>pug</strong>? <strong>T-Rex</strong> vs <strong>Houdini</strong>? <strong>Napoleon</strong> or the <strong>Sphinx</strong>? In Cards, the Universe and Everything (CUE), these deeply important questions are finally answered. Collect the best of history, science, myths, nature and much more\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411830/extras/70824e0187198909f813817788b74bf1.poster.avif?t=1749758616\" width=800 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411830/extras/70824e0187198909f813817788b74bf1.webm?t=1749758616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411830/extras/70824e0187198909f813817788b74bf1.mp4?t=1749758616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>No paywalls, just good old-fashioned wheeling and dealing with players across the world. Build your dream collection, track down and exchange rare cards, or hoard 37 copies of a Honey Badger just for the hell of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411830/extras/f0eabc158bc6f813fd3b2febeb071200.avif?t=1749758616\" data-has-big width=800 height=316 /></span>With over 5,000 cards spanning everything from black holes to Black Hawks, you can build decks that are brilliant, bizarre, or just plain unfair. In case you're wondering, that's more than 434 quintillion possible card combinations per round, so things never get boring.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411830/extras/d5f7c82d0d7fcd66109e1e5cd1d17e27.poster.avif?t=1749758616\" width=800 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411830/extras/d5f7c82d0d7fcd66109e1e5cd1d17e27.webm?t=1749758616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411830/extras/d5f7c82d0d7fcd66109e1e5cd1d17e27.mp4?t=1749758616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Sure, Space, History and Science might sound like a school project, but really, it\u2019s mostly shouting as Henry VIII flattens your quantum physicist and the angry goose you just played ruins everything. Each arena has its own twists, and every card is packed with curious facts to make defeat feel oddly enlightening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411830/extras/e8962acfb6149976ee147fd400767ae3.poster.avif?t=1749758616\" width=800 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411830/extras/e8962acfb6149976ee147fd400767ae3.webm?t=1749758616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411830/extras/e8962acfb6149976ee147fd400767ae3.mp4?t=1749758616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Win trophies, unlock powerful new cards, and collect rewards in regular events. Because who doesn\u2019t love being rewarded for playing cards?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411830/extras/fc0dc306494e5eaf1e14e3ff2f6dfb72.avif?t=1749758616\" data-has-big width=800 height=316 /></span><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong>Craft Special Cards and Fuse Duplicates </strong><br><br>Uncover secret recipes, combine duplicates, and create new cards with game-changing abilities. Or just melt down your spares in a blind panic after a crushing defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411830/extras/30ced61165ae30a83e4d181d5365677e.avif?t=1749758616\" data-has-big width=800 height=316 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Only Card Game Where You Can Collect, Battle, and Trade\u2026 Everything.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411830/extras/2e3f3e1f468f08fdab2044c870c0667d.poster.avif?t=1749758616\" width=800 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411830/extras/2e3f3e1f468f08fdab2044c870c0667d.webm?t=1749758616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411830/extras/2e3f3e1f468f08fdab2044c870c0667d.mp4?t=1749758616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Ever wondered who\u2019d win in a fight, <strong>Loki</strong> or a <strong>pug</strong>? <strong>T-Rex</strong> vs <strong>Houdini</strong>? <strong>Napoleon</strong> or the <strong>Sphinx</strong>? In Cards, the Universe and Everything (CUE), these deeply important questions are finally answered. Collect the best of history, science, myths, nature and much more\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411830/extras/70824e0187198909f813817788b74bf1.poster.avif?t=1749758616\" width=800 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411830/extras/70824e0187198909f813817788b74bf1.webm?t=1749758616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411830/extras/70824e0187198909f813817788b74bf1.mp4?t=1749758616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>No paywalls, just good old-fashioned wheeling and dealing with players across the world. Build your dream collection, track down and exchange rare cards, or hoard 37 copies of a Honey Badger just for the hell of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411830/extras/f0eabc158bc6f813fd3b2febeb071200.avif?t=1749758616\" data-has-big width=800 height=316 /></span>With over 5,000 cards spanning everything from black holes to Black Hawks, you can build decks that are brilliant, bizarre, or just plain unfair. In case you're wondering, that's more than 434 quintillion possible card combinations per round, so things never get boring.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411830/extras/d5f7c82d0d7fcd66109e1e5cd1d17e27.poster.avif?t=1749758616\" width=800 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411830/extras/d5f7c82d0d7fcd66109e1e5cd1d17e27.webm?t=1749758616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411830/extras/d5f7c82d0d7fcd66109e1e5cd1d17e27.mp4?t=1749758616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Sure, Space, History and Science might sound like a school project, but really, it\u2019s mostly shouting as Henry VIII flattens your quantum physicist and the angry goose you just played ruins everything. Each arena has its own twists, and every card is packed with curious facts to make defeat feel oddly enlightening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411830/extras/e8962acfb6149976ee147fd400767ae3.poster.avif?t=1749758616\" width=800 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411830/extras/e8962acfb6149976ee147fd400767ae3.webm?t=1749758616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411830/extras/e8962acfb6149976ee147fd400767ae3.mp4?t=1749758616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Win trophies, unlock powerful new cards, and collect rewards in regular events. Because who doesn\u2019t love being rewarded for playing cards?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411830/extras/fc0dc306494e5eaf1e14e3ff2f6dfb72.avif?t=1749758616\" data-has-big width=800 height=316 /></span><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong>Craft Special Cards and Fuse Duplicates </strong><br><br>Uncover secret recipes, combine duplicates, and create new cards with game-changing abilities. Or just melt down your spares in a blind panic after a crushing defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411830/extras/30ced61165ae30a83e4d181d5365677e.avif?t=1749758616\" data-has-big width=800 height=316 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Cards, the Universe and Everything is a unique trading card game with almost limitless possibilities: Dinosaurs, Norse gods, blue-footed boobies, Samurai, volcanoes, even the god particle. With the universe\u2019s thingamabobs and endless strategies, are you ready for this gloriously bonkers game?",
